cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果使用本基准，请按以下格式引用。"
title: "CapBench: A Six-Dimension Capability Benchmark for Inference-Side Validation"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CapBench contributors"
keywords:
  - large language models
  - evaluation
  - benchmark
  - inference optimization
  - quantization
abstract: >
  A fixed-split, fixed-prompt, fixed-scoring benchmark covering instruction
  following, knowledge, science reasoning, mathematics, coding and long-context
  understanding, intended for validating inference-side optimizations
  (quantization, parallelism, caching, scheduling) on the same model.
references:
